The Press
[trigger none]
[vignette dungeons/foundry]

FIXME(dread): The slam is felt before it is heard, deep and slow as a heartbeat, up through the boots and into the teeth. The lamp finds the nearest press: a black mass coming down on its bed and lifting, coming down and lifting, a worker feeding it, sliding a blank under the die, drawing the hand back, sliding the next. The timing is exact and it is close.
FIXME(horror): Suhail forces nothing. He stoops, picks a heavy tool off the floor, and lobs it underhand into the press bed, into the strike zone, the way a man tosses a stick for a dog. Then he steps back to watch.
FIXME(horror): Another worker comes after it out of the dark, a man, drawn to the misplaced tool, set on returning it to its place. He gets down and starts in under the die, reaching, untroubled, while the ram comes down and lifts and comes down. He seems blind to the danger.
FIXME(dread): Suhail watches you, not the man. "The lattice hates disorder."

choices:

* Haul him clear of the press = Get him out before the stroke
    FIXME(action): He is half under the die, reaching. Getting a hand to his collar means reaching past the stroke line, and the ram is on its down-cycle. The gap between strokes is short.
    @if check combat correct:strategize wrong:rush {
        FIXME(action): Thinking quickly, you grab for a metal pry bar and wedge it under the press. The bar moans horribly as it warps and bends under the immense weight. But it buys you enough time to pull the worker free. He stares at you blankly, then wanders back into the darkness.
        +quality foundry.challenge 1
        +open "The Factory Floor"
    } @else {
        FIXME(action): You lunge but get the timing wrong. The worker absorbs the worst of it, but your arm is crushed in the machinery. You wince with pain. You'll need to find time to bandage and set the arm before it gets worse.
        +add_condition injured
        +quality foundry.challenge 1
        +open "The Factory Floor"
    }

* Leave him to the press = Stand back from the machine
    FIXME(dread): You stay back. He reaches under the die, and you turn away as the press does its grim work. Suhail watches you carefully.
    +open "The Factory Floor"
